# AI Dreaming Center self-study output — evolution proposals (`_context/`) and
# learning notes written by `/self-study` rotation sessions. Kept OUT of git on
# purpose: they are local, ephemeral scratch that the Dreaming Center reads from
# disk. Ignoring them also protects the files from being swept away by
# orchestration agents running `git stash -u` / `git clean -fd`, which skip
# git-ignored paths. Do NOT remove these entries without reading
# docs on the evolutions flow first.
_context/
learning-notes/
